{"_id":"ChLImKXE82rV2foE","name":"Ice Zuggle","type":"npc","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-pf2e/art/zuggle.webp","items":[{"_id":"aaTh0aRpoMpirE8X","name":"Element Sense","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Zuggles can detect sources of elemental magic within the listed range as an imprecise sense. This includes any creatures, spells, or abilities with the elemental, air, earth, fire, or water trait.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"fEfiycx6ttQYzUMb","name":"Zuggle Orbs","type":"equipment","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/consumables/talismans/effervescent-ampoule.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Zuggles naturally produce fist-sized globules of element-infused protein, which they store in specialized pouches that run the length of their spine near their fin. A zuggle can launch these globules at predators for self-defense, but alchemists and others prize these \"zuggle orbs\" for their unique magical properties and take care to extract them without scaring or hurting the zuggle.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[